WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.491 --> 00:00:13.892
flew away from the angry crowd.

2
00:00:16.494 --> 00:00:17.274
Her watch beeped.

3
00:00:21.537 --> 00:00:23.299
"Detective Smith," Roxy said.

4
00:00:23.319 --> 00:00:24.419
"What's up?"

5
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.381
"I'm out of jail," Detective Smith said.

6
00:00:27.401 --> 00:00:30.904
"Another officer found video from a traffic camera.

7
00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:33.753
It shows that you didn't blow up the car."

8
00:00:35.094 --> 00:00:35.914
Roxy smiled.

9
00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:38.775
"Whew!" The detective cleared his throat.

10
00:00:38.795 --> 00:00:42.437
"The Tattle Twins have another emergency."

11
00:00:43.258 --> 00:00:44.418
Roxy rolled her eyes.

12
00:00:44.438 --> 00:00:46.699
"I was just there.

13
00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.880
They didn't have an emergency."

14
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.482
"They said they do now," Detective Smith said.

15
00:00:53.643 --> 00:00:54.443
Roxy sighed.

16
00:00:54.463 --> 00:01:03.529
"Okay." Outside 100 West Street, Roxy used her super hearing.

17
00:01:03.549 --> 00:01:05.709
"Give us the money in the safe!"

18
00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:06.790
a man said.

19
00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:08.950
"Uh-oh," Roxy thought.

20
00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:10.911
"There is an emergency!"

21
00:01:10.931 --> 00:01:14.412
"There's no money," Pam said.

22
00:01:14.432 --> 00:01:17.473
"The safe is empty," Cam said.

23
00:01:18.193 --> 00:01:19.813
Roxy flew into the twins' apartment.

24
00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:22.854
Three mean-looking men held crowbars.

25
00:01:22.874 --> 00:01:24.815
"Rocket Girl!"

26
00:01:25.115 --> 00:01:25.755
Pam said.

27
00:01:25.775 --> 00:01:27.455
"I'm glad you're here!"

28
00:01:28.416 --> 00:01:29.056
Cam nodded.

29
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:30.940
"So glad!"

30
00:01:31.741 --> 00:01:33.201
The man with the beard grinned.

31
00:01:33.221 --> 00:01:34.782
"Rocket Girl!

32
00:01:35.022 --> 00:01:37.083
Help us break open that safe!"

33
00:01:37.103 --> 00:01:39.904
"Huh?" Roxy was confused.

34
00:01:40.604 --> 00:01:42.545
"You're a bad guy now, right?"

35
00:01:42.965 --> 00:01:43.786
another man said.

36
00:01:44.826 --> 00:01:45.807
Roxy was shocked.

37
00:01:46.607 --> 00:01:47.667
But she had an idea.

38
00:01:47.687 --> 00:01:50.108
"Actually, yes."

39
00:01:50.468 --> 00:01:51.109
She smiled.

40
00:01:51.129 --> 00:01:53.510
"I'm a bad guy now."

41
00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:55.971
Pam and Cam gasped.

42
00:01:56.011 --> 00:02:00.016
"Give me your crowbars," Roxy said.

43
00:02:00.036 --> 00:02:02.218
"I'll break open the safe."

44
00:02:03.418 --> 00:02:04.159
Pam huffed.

45
00:02:04.879 --> 00:02:06.420
"There's no money."

46
00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.121
"The safe is empty!"

47
00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:10.182
Cam said.

48
00:02:10.942 --> 00:02:13.103
The man with the beard handed his crowbar to Roxy.

49
00:02:15.005 --> 00:02:17.106
Roxy quickly twisted it around his wrists.

50
00:02:17.126 --> 00:02:21.408
"Hey!" The man struggled to move his arms.

51
00:02:21.428 --> 00:02:23.309
"What's going on?"

52
00:02:23.329 --> 00:02:25.290
"You're under arrest!"

53
00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:26.411
Roxy said.

54
00:02:27.111 --> 00:02:28.692
The other two men ran toward Roxy.

55
00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.161
She used her heat vision on the crowbars.

56
00:02:32.761 --> 00:02:35.523
"Ouch!" The men dropped the hot crowbars.

57
00:02:35.543 --> 00:02:38.124
"We give up!"

58
00:02:38.204 --> 00:02:40.745
"Thanks, Rocket Girl."

59
00:02:41.385 --> 00:02:42.566
Pam stared at the floor.

60
00:02:42.586 --> 00:02:45.127
"We're sorry for what we did."

61
00:02:46.207 --> 00:02:46.867
Cam nodded.

62
00:02:46.887 --> 00:02:49.648
"We just wanted to be famous."

63
00:02:50.669 --> 00:02:51.489
Roxy frowned.

64
00:02:51.509 --> 00:02:53.690
"You made me look like a bad guy.

65
00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.852
And making fake videos that harm people is against the law.

66
00:02:58.272 --> 00:03:00.773
You're going to have to pay a big fine."

67
00:03:01.874 --> 00:03:02.654
Pam gulped.

68
00:03:02.674 --> 00:03:04.655
"We won't do it again."

69
00:03:05.535 --> 00:03:06.195
Cam nodded.

70
00:03:06.215 --> 00:03:09.417
"We lost all of our followers."

71
00:03:09.437 --> 00:03:12.578
"Really?" Roxy scratched her head.

72
00:03:14.138 --> 00:03:16.559
Roxy brought the men to jail and returned to the theater.

73
00:03:22.262 --> 00:03:23.282
She whispered to Terrell.

74
00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:26.063
"The Tattle Twins lost all of their followers."

75
00:03:26.083 --> 00:03:27.924
"I know,"
